  "description_short": "Family-run Italian restaurant in Sedgefield serving authentic pizzas, pastas, and Mediterranean classics since 2008.",
  "description_long": "Tucked along Sedgefield's main road, Montecello has been serving honest Italian fare to locals and travellers for over a decade. The family-run restaurant combines Old World recipes with Garden Route hospitality, creating a warm atmosphere that keeps people coming back. The wood-fired pizzas are a crowd favourite, with thin, crispy bases and generous toppings, while the pasta dishes showcase traditional preparation methods passed down through generations.\n\nThe menu covers Italian classics without unnecessary fuss — think hearty lasagnes, creamy risottos, and seafood linguine that makes the most of local catches. The outdoor seating area is perfect for leisurely lunches, especially when the weather cooperates. Montecello also offers accommodation upstairs, making it a convenient stop for those exploring the Garden Route.\n\nWhat sets this place apart is its consistency and genuine hospitality. The staff treat regulars and first-timers with equal warmth, and the kitchen maintains quality even during busy holiday periods. It's the kind of neighbourhood spot that becomes a ritual for locals and a pleasant discovery for visitors passing through Sedgefield.",
